<title>UK: Lehman sets warrants on Preussag.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets warrants on Preussag.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said it has issued five million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on German steel company Preussag single stocks.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE STOCK	  PAY DATE   23.SEP.96</p>
<p>REFERENCE LEVEL    360 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	    STRIKE  MATURITY  PRICE    PREMIUM  GEARING</p>
<p>SPRINTER CALL I  350 DEM 13.JUN.97 2.80 DEM 5.00 PCT 12.86 X</p>
<p>SPRINTER CALL II 375 DEM 13.JUN.97 1.58 DEM 8.56 PCT 22.79 X</p>
<p>MARATHON CALLIII 400 DEM 15.JAN.99 2.40 DEM 17.78PCT 15.00 X</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
